# M5: a met criterion whose oracle artifact does not exist. The literal string is
# real: `battery-run-final.log` is cited as the measurement evidence by R43, R44 AND
# R45, and is absent from the repo AND from git history
# (`git log --all -- "*battery-run-final*"` -> empty). Three live register rows rest
# their measurement on a file nobody can open. This fixture is SHACL-clean by design:
# the graph cannot see the filesystem, so only the pytest leg can refuse it.
prog:criterion:tab:region-tiling-failed a prog:Criterion ;
